      item-23 at level 3: text:  and the input for position 
      item-24 at level 3: formula: t
      item-25 at level 3: text: . This inherently sequential nat ... uential computation, however, remains.
  item-26 at level 1: text: Attention mechanisms have become ...  conjunction with a recurrent network.
  item-27 at level 1: text: In this work we propose the Tran ... le as twelve hours on eight P100 GPUs.
