  item-581 at level 1: section_header: Attention Visualizations
  item-582 at level 1: section: group figure
    item-583 at level 2: picture
      item-583 at level 3: caption: An example of the attention mechanism following long-distance dependencies in the encoder self-attention in layer 5 of 6. Many of the attention heads attend to a distant dependency of the verb `making', completing the phrase `making...more difficult'.  Attentions here shown only for the word `making'. Different colors represent different heads. Best viewed in color.
    item-584 at level 2: caption: An example of the attention mech ... different heads. Best viewed in color.
  item-585 at level 1: section: group figure
    item-586 at level 2: picture
      item-586 at level 3: caption: Two attention heads, also in layer 5 of 6, apparently involved in anaphora resolution. Top: Full attentions for head 5. Bottom: Isolated attentions from just the word `its' for attention heads 5 and 6. Note that the attentions are very sharp for this word.
    item-587 at level 2: picture
    item-588 at level 2: caption: Two attention heads, also in lay ... tentions are very sharp for this word.
  item-589 at level 1: section: group figure
    item-590 at level 2: picture
      item-590 at level 3: caption: Many of the attention heads exhibit behaviour that seems related to the structure of the sentence. We give two such examples above, from two different heads from the encoder self-attention at layer 5 of 6. The heads clearly learned to perform different tasks.
    item-591 at level 2: picture
    item-592 at level 2: caption: Many of the attention heads exhi ... ly learned to perform different tasks.